        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html>\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>语文练习册 第23页</title>\n  <style>\n    * {\n      box-sizing: border-box;\n      margin: 0;\n      padding: 0;\n    }\n    body {\n      font-family: \"SimSun\", \"宋体\", serif;\n      font-size: 14px;\n      background: #f0f4fa;\n      display: flex;\n      justify-content: center;\n      padding: 20px;\n    }\n    .page {\n      background: #fff;\n      width: 420px;\n      min-height: 580px;\n      padding: 18px 20px 24px 20px;\n      border: 1px solid #ccc;\n      position: relative;\n      box-shadow: 2px 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.15);\n    }\n    .header {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: flex-end;\n      margin-bottom: 6px;\n    }\n    .header-badge {\n      background: #4a90d9;\n      color: #fff;\n      font-size: 11px;\n      padding: 2px 8px;\n      border-radius: 4px;\n      font-weight: bold;\n    }\n    .subject-title {\n      text-align: right;\n      font-size: 18px;\n      font-weight: bold;\n      color: #222;\n      margin-bottom: 8px;\n      letter-spacing: 4px;\n    }\n    .section-title {\n      font-size: 13px;\n      font-weight: bold;\n      color: #333;\n      margin: 8px 0 4px 0;\n      border-left: 3px solid #4a90d9;\n      padding-left: 5px;\n    }\n    .question-block {\n      margin-bottom: 8px;\n    }\n    .question-num {\n      font-weight: bold;\n      margin-right: 4px;\n    }\n    .question-line {\n      margin: 3px 0;\n      line-height: 1.8;\n      color: #222;\n    }\n    .indent {\n      text-indent: 2em;\n    }\n    .choice-row {\n      display: flex;\n      gap: 16px;\n      margin: 3px 0 3px 1.5em;\n      flex-wrap: wrap;\n    }\n    .choice-item {\n      min-width: 80px;\n    }\n    .answer-line {\n      display: inline-block;\n      border-bottom: 1px solid #333;\n      min-width: 40px;\n      margin: 0 2px;\n    }\n    .handwritten {\n      font-family: \"KaiTi\", \"楷体\", cursive;\n      color: #1a1a6e;\n    }\n    .fill-answer {\n      color: #1a1a6e;\n      font-family: \"KaiTi\", \"楷体\", cursive;\n    }\n    .main-content {\n      display: flex;\n      gap: 8px;\n    }\n    .left-col {\n      flex: 1;\n    }\n    .right-col {\n      width: 120px;\n    }\n    .divider {\n      border: none;\n      border-top: 1px dashed #aaa;\n      margin: 8px 0;\n    }\n    .page-num {\n      position: absolute;\n      bottom: 8px;\n      left: 18px;\n      font-size: 12px;\n      color: #888;\n    }\n    .icon-placeholder {\n      display: inline-block;\n      width: 32px;\n      height: 32px;\n      background: #d0e8f8;\n      border-radius: 50%;\n      text-align: center;\n      line-height: 32px;\n      font-size: 10px;\n      color: #4a90d9;\n      margin-right: 4px;\n      vertical-align: middle;\n    }\n    .stamp {\n      display: inline-block;\n      border: 2px solid #4a90d9;\n      border-radius: 50%;\n      padding: 4px 6px;\n      font-size: 11px;\n      color: #4a90d9;\n      margin: 0 4px;\n    }\n    .sub-indent {\n      padding-left: 2em;\n    }\n    .bracket {\n      font-size: 13px;\n    }\n    .note-box {\n      border: 1px solid #b0c8e8;\n      background: #eaf3fb;\n      border-radius: 6px;\n      padding: 6px 10px;\n      margin: 6px 0;\n      font-size: 12px;\n    }\n    .right-margin-note {\n      writing-mode: horizontal-tb;\n      font-size: 11px;\n      color: #555;\n      margin-top: 8px;\n      border-left: 2px solid #4a90d9;\n      padding-left: 4px;\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <div class=\"page\">\n\n    <!-- Header -->\n    <div class=\"header\">\n      <span class=\"header-badge\">同步训练</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"subject-title\">语&nbsp;&nbsp;文</div>\n\n    <hr class=\"divider\">\n\n    <!-- Section 一 -->\n    <div class=\"question-block\">\n      <div class=\"question-line\">\n        <span class=\"question-num\">一、</span>\n        <span>拼一拼，在括号里填上合适的汉字。<span class=\"fill-answer\">（4）</span></span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"question-line sub-indent\">\n        A. bó &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; B. she &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; C. bo &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; D. yǎ\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"question-line sub-indent\">\n        <span>她</span><span class=\"fill-answer\">（&nbsp;瘦削&nbsp;）</span>，\n        A. <span class=\"fill-answer\">（&nbsp;）</span>&nbsp;\n        B. <span class=\"fill-answer\">（&nbsp;）</span>&nbsp;\n        C. <span class=\"fill-answer\">（&nbsp;）</span>&nbsp;\n        D. <span class=\"fill-answer\">（&nbsp;）</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"question-line sub-indent\">\n        <span class=\"fill-answer\">（被）正确</span>，\n        A.薄弱 &nbsp; B. <span class=\"fill-answer\">（&nbsp;）</span> &nbsp; C.哑巴 &nbsp; D.折腾\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <hr class=\"divider\">\n\n    <!-- Section 二 -->\n    <div class=\"question-block\">\n      <div class=\"question-line\">\n        <span class=\"question-num\">二、</span>\n        <span>把下面的词语补充完整，并选词填空。</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"choice-row\">\n        <span class=\"choice-item\">本（&nbsp;<span class=\"fill-answer\">领</span>&nbsp;）</span>\n        <span class=\"choice-item\">成（&nbsp;<span class=\"fill-answer\">绩</span>&nbsp;）</span>\n        <span class=\"choice-item\">表（&nbsp;<span class=\"fill-answer\">扬</span>&nbsp;）</span>\n        <span class=\"choice-item\">奖（&nbsp;<span class=\"fill-answer\">励</span>&nbsp;）</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"question-line sub-indent\">\n        <span>这次语文考试，她取得了很好的</span>\n        <span class=\"fill-answer\">成绩</span>，\n        受到了老师的<span class=\"fill-answer\">表扬</span>。\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <hr class=\"divider\">\n\n    <!-- Section 三 (Main) -->\n    <div class=\"question-block\">\n      <div class=\"question-line\">\n        <span class=\"question-num\">三、</span>\n        <span>阅读下面的短文，完成练习。</span>\n      </div>\n\n      <!-- Sub-questions -->\n      <div class=\"question-line indent\" style=\"margin-top:4px;\">\n        1. 从短文中找出下列词语的近义词。\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"question-line sub-indent\">\n        <span>服从—（<span class=\"fill-answer\">听从</span>）</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;\n        <span>勇敢—（<span class=\"fill-answer\">英勇</span>）</span>&nbsp;&nbsp;\n        <span>优秀—（<span class=\"fill-answer\">优异</span>）</span>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"question-line indent\" style=\"margin-top:4px;\">\n        2. 用波浪线画出文中描写叶欣工作场景的句子，并仿写一句。（任意）\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"question-line sub-indent\">\n        <span class=\"handwritten\">她在病房里穿梭忙碌，头发凌乱，顾不上喝一口水。</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"question-line sub-indent\">\n        <span>仿写：</span><span class=\"handwritten\">消防员在火场上英勇无畏，汗流浃背，</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"question-line sub-indent\" style=\"padding-left:4em;\">\n        <span class=\"handwritten\">顾不上休息片刻。</span>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"question-line indent\" style=\"margin-top:4px;\">\n        3. 叶欣为什么不让其他同事进入隔离区？\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"question-line sub-indent\">\n        <span>因为</span><span class=\"handwritten\">隔离区充满了危险，她不想让其他同事也面临</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"question-line sub-indent\" style=\"padding-left:3em;\">\n        <span class=\"handwritten\">感染的危险，她用自己的身体保护大家。</span>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"question-line indent\" style=\"margin-top:4px;\">\n        4. 结合短文内容，写出你对\"这里危险，让我来\"这句话的理解。\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"question-line sub-indent\">\n        <span class=\"handwritten\">叶欣在最危险的地方，用这句话表达了她保护</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"question-line sub-indent\" style=\"padding-left:3em;\">\n        <span class=\"handwritten\">同事的决心，体现了她无私奉献、英勇无畏的精神。</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"question-line sub-indent\" style=\"padding-left:3em;\">\n        <span class=\"handwritten\">（任务一）</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"question-line sub-indent\" style=\"padding-left:3em;\">\n        <span class=\"handwritten\">（总结）</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Left side vertical notes -->\n    <div style=\"margin-top:10px;\">\n      <div class=\"question-line\">\n        <span class=\"question-num\">3.</span>\n        <span>一（&nbsp;<span class=\"fill-answer\">声</span>&nbsp;）——一（&nbsp;<span class=\"fill-answer\">声</span>&nbsp;）</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"question-line\">\n        <span>一（&nbsp;<span class=\"fill-answer\">群</span>&nbsp;）——一（&nbsp;<span class=\"fill-answer\">群</span>&nbsp;）</span>\n        <span style=\"margin-left:8px; font-size:11px; color:#888;\">动植物</span>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"question-line sub-indent\" style=\"font-size:11px;\">\n        <span class=\"handwritten\">（认真填写，完成每道题）</span>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"page-num\">23</div>\n  </div>\n</body>\n</html>"
